de eventos ni el índice de bloques", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "nunca se borra la versión activa, la cola de eventos ni el índice de bloques", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t62"}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 650, "y": 704, "width": 0, "height": 20, "strokeColor": "#5c5c5c", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 20]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "a63"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 726, "width": 290, "height": 45.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "5. Descarga por bloques con HTTP Range. Si\n   se corta la red guarda el índice, y al\n   volver pide solo los rangos que faltan.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5. Descarga por bloques con HTTP Range. Si\n   se corta la red guarda el índice, y al\n   volver pide solo los rangos que faltan.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t64"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 366, "y": 724, "width": 830, "height": 96, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725