Size": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "9. Lo que hicieron sin red queda en una\n   cola. Cuando vuelve la señal sale hacia\n   Lima con un identificador que se\n   congeló al crearse.\n\n   Si el envío se reintenta, Lima lo\n   reconoce y no lo procesa dos veces.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t120"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 366, "y": 1268, "width": 830, "height": 150, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r121"}, {"type": "text", "x": 380, "y": 1275, "width": 445, "height": 13.75, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "BLOQUE C  ·  El retorno vuelve una sola vez  ·  PD-3 + PD-6  ·  7 casos", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "BLOQUE C  ·  El retorno vuelve una sola vez  ·  PD-3 + PD-6  ·  7 casos", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t122"}, {"type": "ellipse", "x": 392, "y": 1294, "width": 148, "height": 78, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor